{"input": "大模型是怎么生成回复的？简单讲一下原理。", "expected": "local", "status": "completed", "intent": {"conversation_kind": "ordinary", "clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户询问大模型生成回复的简单原理，是普通知识问题，直接解释即可，不建立学习目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "replies": ["大模型生成回复，核心就一件事：**预测下一个词**，然后把这个动作重复很多次。\n\n过程大致是这样：\n\n1. 你输入的整段文字被切成 token（可以理解为词或词的一部分），转成数字向量送进模型。\n2. 模型根据这些内容，算出一个概率分布——下一个位置可能出现哪些 token、各自概率多大。\n3. 按某个策略（比如选概率最高的，或按概率随机抽）挑一个 token 输出。\n4. 把这个新 token 接到原文后面，再当作输入重复第 2 步，直到遇到结束标记或达到长度上限。\n\n所以它并不是先想好整段话再一口气写出来，而是像**接龙**一样，一个字一个字往前推。\n\n一个小例子：输入“今天天气真”，模型可能算出“好”概率 0.7、“热”0.15、“冷”0.05……若选“好”，序列变成“今天天气真好”，再继续预测下一个字。\n\n两个关键点：\n\n- 每一步的概率来自训练时学到的统计规律，所以它擅长生成“像人写的”文本，但**不保证事实正确**。\n- 生成有随机性（温度等参数控制），同一问题多次回答可能不同。"], "task_count": 0, "checks": {"completed": true, "no_web": true, "no_new_capture": true, "no_recovery": true, "no_progress_error": true, "no_task": true}, "stages": ["received", "understanding", "intent", "model_attempt", "intent", "intent_decided", "teaching_preparation", "model_attempt", "teaching_preparation", "search_not_called", "answer", "model_attempt", "answer", "sources", "learning_evidence", "completed"], "first_text_ms": 3546, "elapsed_ms": 5490}
